  question: 'I am making a history of the area where I live. I would:'
  optionA: Gather old maps and charts.
  optionB: Record stories from people talking about old times.
  optionC: Read articles and other information in old newspapers and documents.
  optionD: Compare historical photos of the area with what is there now.
